---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Methods — VIOT Research" page="methods" description="VIOT-3 axisymmetric and VIOT-4 3D+DSMC framework architecture.">
  <div class="container">
    <section class="hero">
      <p class="hero-eyebrow">Methodology</p>
      <h1>Framework Architecture</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">The Virtual Ion-Optics Testbed progressed through five phases. Production results are driven by VIOT-3 (axisymmetric) and VIOT-4 (3D + DSMC + MD).</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-label-col"><h2 class="label">Phase III</h2></div>
        <div>
          <p class="phase-tag phase-tag--done">Complete — 70/70 tests</p>
          <h3 class="section-title">VIOT-3: Axisymmetric</h3>
          <div class="prose-block">
            <p>Production framework for the core erosion campaign. Models barrel erosion — axisymmetric, inside aperture wall. Corrects all 15 defects identified in VIOT-2.</p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
            <p class="label">Physics implementation</p>
            <div class="defect-table">
              <div class="defect-head">
                <div>#</div>
                <div>Defect in VIOT-2</div>
                <div>Correction in VIOT-3</div>
              </div>
              <div class="defect-row">
                <div class="defect-num">1</div>
                <div>CUDA Red–Black SOR Poisson had block-sync errors, non-convergent</div>
                <div>SuperLU direct factorization</div>
              </div>
              <div class="defect-row">
                <div class="defect-num">2</div>
                <div>Sputter-yield lookup discarded the angle axis</div>
                <div>2D (E, θ) bilinear interpolation</div>
              </div>
              <div class="defect-row">
                <div class="defect-num">3</div>
                <div>Post-CEX velocity set to exactly 0</div>
                <div>Maxwellian sampling at 400 K</div>
              </div>
              <div class="defect-row">
                <div class="defect-num">4</div>
                <div>Half-acceleration push (not leapfrog)</div>
                <div>True leapfrog + backward half-kick</div>
              </div>
              <div class="defect-row">
                <div class="defect-num">5</div>
                <div>MCC double-counting</div>
                <div>Correct null-collision ratio</div>
              </div>
              <div class="defect-row">
                <div class="defect-num">6</div>
                <div>ν_max computed at wrong n_gas</div>
                <div>Recomputed from cross-section</div>
              </div>
              <div class="defect-row">
                <div class="defect-num">7</div>
                <div>Erosion ignored macroparticle weight</div>
                <div>Y × w_real</div>
              </div>
              <div class="defect-row">
                <div class="defect-num">8</div>
                <div>Particles seeded inside solid cells</div>
                <div>Plasma cells only</div>
              </div>
              <div class="defect-row">
                <div class="defect-num">9</div>
                <div>Upstream boundary φ = 0</div>
                <div>φ = V_screen</div>
              </div>
              <div class="defect-row">
                <div class="defect-num">10</div>
                <div>No Bohm drift at injection</div>
                <div>u_B + thermal spread</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-label-col"><h2 class="label">Phase IV</h2></div>
        <div>
          <p class="phase-tag phase-tag--active">Core complete — 2/2 tests</p>
          <h3 class="section-title">VIOT-4: 3D + DSMC + MD</h3>
          <div class="prose-block">
            <p>Extends the framework to 3D to capture pit-and-groove erosion on the downstream face and interstitial web. Integrates DSMC neutral flow and LAMMPS AIREBO crystalline MD for graphene substrate interactions.</p>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
            <p class="label">Adversarial review: 5 bugs found and fixed</p>
            <div class="timeline" data-gsap="timeline">
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <span class="timeline-num">01</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="timeline-title">Poisson operator sign bug</p>
                  <p class="timeline-body">x/y off-diagonals were +1, z were −1, assembling 6I + Nx + Ny − Nz — not a Laplacian. CG "converged" to the wrong operator. Fixed: all six off-diagonals −1. Verified: residual 1.7e-11.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <span class="timeline-num">02</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="timeline-title">MD projectile velocity off by 10¹⁰</p>
                  <p class="timeline-body">Unit conversion applied ×1e-12 instead of ×1e-2. Projectiles were effectively stationary → ~zero sputter. Fixed; verified 300 eV Xe → 210 Å/ps.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <span class="timeline-num">03</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="timeline-title">Sputter count counted Xe as C</p>
                  <p class="timeline-body">Used total-atom delta, tallying exiting Xe projectiles as sputtered carbon. Fixed: count type-1 (C) atoms only via per-atom type array.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <span class="timeline-num">04</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="timeline-title">Engine reinject teleported all particles</p>
                  <p class="timeline-body">Reseeded every slot each step, discarding mid-flight ions. Erosion was 19 atoms instead of ~1e8. Fixed: refill only inactive slots.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <span class="timeline-num">05</span>
                <div>
                  <p class="timeline-title">DSMC collision not NTC</p>
                  <p class="timeline-body">Fixed p=0.3 with unused σ, no cell-volume/dt scaling. Fixed: proper No-Time-Counter acceptance P = σ·g·dt/V_cell.</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="section-inner">
        <div class="section-label-col"><h2 class="label">Scope</h2></div>
        <div>
          <div class="scope-grid">
            <div class="scope-col">
              <p class="scope-title">In scope</p>
              <ul class="scope-items">
                <li>Relative material rankings for barrel erosion and EBS lifetime</li>
                <li>Atomistic yield derivation (RustBCA + LAMMPS AIREBO MD)</li>
                <li>Field-emission and thermomechanical risk screening</li>
                <li>3D framework construction and verification</li>
                <li>Fowler–Nordheim breakdown risk (Weibull model)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="scope-col">
              <p class="scope-title">Explicitly out of scope</p>
              <ul class="scope-items">
                <li>Absolute wear rates</li>
                <li>ELT-validated lifetimes</li>
                <li>Dynamic erosion-coupled mesh evolution</li>
                <li>In-loop DSMC coupling (pending)</li>
                <li>Flight qualification of any coating</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>

</BaseLayout>
